WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:08,440
Lu Shutang is willing to come, but he can't listen to everything from the beginning.

2
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:11,040
I'm not interested in raising a person who can only act like a star.

3
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:13,040
Then give him a chance to prove his worth.

4
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,880
he can sing

5
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,180
Can do simple dance

6
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:22,240
It’s not like I can’t do physical work at all.

7
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:25,650
The news you bring today is worth it.

8
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:28,050
But I remind you, you can bring others with you.

9
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:31,810
But whether he wants to stay or not is his own business. Don't treat people as bargaining chips.

10
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,210
I just want one more way out.

11
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:38,560
Then rely on your own ability.

12
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:42,160
How about, come with me tomorrow, so quickly, take off something else, and you will have one less day to retreat.

13
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,160
What conditions did he impose?

14
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,760
He only said, prove the value first.

15
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:48,660
If I can't find enough food tomorrow, I'll still reduce the amount of dinner and don't want anyone.

16
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:51,460
Now I still think that face is important. What time will I leave tomorrow? I will leave as soon as dawn.

17
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:53,660
Let me first say that I will only do what I can accept.

18
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:55,860
Okay, let’s survive first and then talk about anything else.
